          "snippet": {
            "text": "theorem count_line_window {N : ℕ} [NeZero N] {χ : DirichletCharacter ℂ N} (hχ : χ.IsPrimitive)\n    (hχ1 : χ ≠ 1) {T T0 : ℝ} (hT0 : 0 ≤ T0) (S : Finset ℂ) (hS : S ⊆ zerosRect χ T)\n    (hre : ∀ u ∈ S, u.re = 1 / 2) (him : ∀ u ∈ S, |u.im| ≤ T0) (k : ℕ) :\n    ∑ u ∈ S.filter (fun u => (⌊u.im / 3.48⌋ + Jl T0).toNat = k), (multRect χ T u : ℝ) ≤ ZL N T0 :=",
